      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ROCKANDAHARDPLACE (8) settled close to the pace but couldn't finish the race off and could only manage seventh last start over 2200m at Launceston, that effort coming after a solid fourth at this track the run before. Will enjoy a pretty soft run from this draw, with the sprint lane to play a big role. Perfectly placed and is sure to be there at the finish. ALWAYS AURORA (1) turned in a much better run last start when runner-up over 2090m at this track, beaten a head. No excuses from this advantageous draw. Tackles a similar assignment and he can go one better without surprising. KOSTYUK LEIS (6) is better than her last-start tenth over 2200m at Launceston. Has each-way claims. MONTGOMERY BURNS NZ (3) is worth some thought despite his last-start sixth over 2579m at this track on October 11.",
